---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Resources | Emon Hossain — Practical AI & Systems References"
  description="A curated resource area for Emon Hossain's public-safe AI systems notes, workflow references, research and future templates."
  ogTitle="Resources — Emon Hossain"
>
  <div class="container section" style="max-width:46rem;">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">RESOURCES</div>
      <h2>Useful references, not placeholder products.</h2>
      <p>Only resources that are actually public, usable and properly documented should be presented as available. Future templates remain clearly marked until they are ready.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <a href="/writing" class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">AVAILABLE</div>
        <h3>Writing & Build Notes</h3>
        <p>Practical notes on AI systems, workflow design, business operations and adoption.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Browse writing →</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/bangladeshai" class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">AVAILABLE</div>
        <h3>Research & Public-Interest Work</h3>
        <p>Bangladesh-focused AI adoption and governance work, kept separate from commercial product claims.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Explore research →</div>
      </a>
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">IN DEVELOPMENT</div>
        <h3>Workflow & System Templates</h3>
        <p>Public templates will be listed only after the files, usage instructions, version and support expectations are ready.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">IN DEVELOPMENT</div>
        <h3>AI Tool & Opportunity Guides</h3>
        <p>Future guides will prioritize verified eligibility, direct sources and practical implementation over copied tool lists.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
